# strand-eval reference recordings (docs/eval.md, "Reference recordings"). Written by `strand-eval approve` and `verdict`; a block edited by hand fails its seal.
ref "notif-groups-reorder"
verdict good
note "eval-coverage-3 first reference, read frame by frame: at 90 Hz the mail group glides above chat while its parcel entry fades in at its top and its entries reorder, then the chat entries swap while the groups swap back: three levels glide at once, each child's glide measured from its parent's; the header stays"
